WEBVTT

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.320
Please come in.

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:24.460
I pity all of those people at Globe.

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:27.420
They have no idea that you're the one

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:31.420
selecting every participant of the Kivotos Plan.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.630
Indeed.

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.100
I feel kinda bad for CEO Kube.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:42.850
I'm sure he never even suspected that we were using him...

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:50.480
Albion may have become somewhat attached to his avatar body...

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:53.990
I definitely don't hate mine.

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:59.080
This is a decade-old photograph of one of the Seton Company's research facilities

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:00.950
in the Hawaiian Islands.

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:07.500
It was quite cleverly hidden, but they're still a subsidiary of Macbeth Enterprises.

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:09.210
It was these two.

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:21.010
We believe these two were
behind the attack yesterday.

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:24.730
Then Macbeth Enterprises was indeed behind this.

00:01:24.730 --> 00:01:27.600
These two are Designer's Children, right?

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:31.150
They were also overseas during the Kanda incident.

00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:36.740
In short, all six that were taken in, with the
exception of Arashi Teppei, are currently missing.

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:40.660
And like Teppei, the other Designer's Children

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:44.290
can use the Machine Goodfellows to become Kill-T-Gangs.

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:48.330
I suspect that the fact the Kill-T-Gangs have entered their active phase

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:52.710
may also mean that all of their
preparations have been completed.

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:56.220
Why aren't they attacking more frequently?

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:00.470
When Teppei became a Kill-T-Gang,

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:04.220
Hana used the energy built up in the Blume.

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:06.060
Teppei claims that

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:12.940
the Kill-T-Gangs' version of a "mothership" is presently trapped in orbit around Uranus.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:17.530
The ship's energy stocks have run dry, and it can't move.

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:20.530
Because of that, they've unleashed the Machine Goodfellows

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:25.240
in order to harvest the energy they need from the people of Earth.

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:29.460
They're after the human libido... Orgone energy.

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:33.420
At any rate, we're not going to appraise HQ of this information yet.

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:36.420
If Salty Dog were to discover

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:39.590
the truth of the relationship between the Machine Goodfellows and the Kill-T-Gangs,

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:42.930
they might take it upon themselves to do something drastic like

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:46.600
nuke all of Tokyo just to destroy Macbeth's offices
there, and blame terrorists for the civilian casualties.

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:50.520
And even if an action like that saved the rest of humanity,

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:54.900
you wouldn't accept it, would you?

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:00.490
Anyway,

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:03.200
it's incredibly strange

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:06.080
that the general public can remain completely
oblivious with such a huge threat looming.

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:09.540
At the height of Cuban Missile Crisis...

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:13.380
Every major media outlet said that if the Russians

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:17.550
brought nuclear missiles to Cuba, full-scale nuclear war would follow.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:23.800
In the end, the Soviets gave in, and the danger was averted.

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:25.760
At least, that's the story the public knew.

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:32.190
In truth, however, the Soviets already had more
than one hundred missiles stationed in Cuba.

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:36.820
Only the American President and a few of his close advisors knew,

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:41.900
and the truth wasn't revealed until thirty years after the Cold War had ended.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:46.870
It really is strange that news of such a dire threat was never leaked to the public.

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:53.250
What purpose could possibly be served by telling the public they could die at any moment?

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:58.210
When real danger exists, it's kept secret from the general populace.

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:01.470
This has happened countless times throughout history.

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:15.770
All the laughter, all the tears—everything happened just to meet you

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:16.440
Always go

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.860
On my own

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:23.070
Always go

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:34.710
The wind blows my overflowing tears away (the wind blows them away)

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:42.090
I try to reach out my hand time after time toward what's to come

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:48.180
I've been hurt before by careless words

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:57.100
It's time I move forward with that unchangeable past

00:04:57.100 --> 00:05:00.650
All the laughter, all the tears—

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:10.280
everything that has happened brought me to you

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:16.330
All we have left is the future

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:22.760
Please become our reason to continue living

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:29.470
And then the sun will once again shine on us

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:39.150
Ta-da!

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:41.270
Snack time!

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:43.610
Watermelon again?

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:44.740
Not to your liking?

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:47.280
Not at all.

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:51.830
Times like these won't continue for much longer.

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:59.380
Pitz was saying that.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:02.500
It's nice that you can talk to Pitz.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:05.090
It makes you seem like a heroine.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:14.390
If even a single Kill-T-Gang makes it to Earth,

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:18.480
it will drain all of humanity of their libidos.

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:21.400
That does make sense...

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:28.990
The first time that I sensed them,

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:31.410
I just got this awful feeling.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:34.870
Well, we have Teppei if we need him.

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:38.750
To be honest, if I become a Kill-T-Gang again, I don't know

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:40.920
if I'll be able to return to who I am now.

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.960
At any rate, we shouldn't underestimate them.

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:50.430
Didn't the Planetary Gears try to make you fire the Livlaster

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:54.010
because they wanted infinite energy, Hana?

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:54.930
Yeah.

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:59.440
And none of them can fire the Livlaster?

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:00.480
Right.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:06.440
You know,

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:10.820
we're pretty amazing, talking about heavy stuff
like this while sitting around eating watermelon.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:12.820
We are, aren't we?

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:14.830
And get this... I have melons, too.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:15.910
Melons!

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:17.200
Melons?

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:19.710
But the melons are for tomorrow.

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:21.330
Disappointment.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:23.000
Disappointment.

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:28.010
Let's all eat together again tomorrow.

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:36.390
While you're here, why don't you eat?

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:37.680
Melons...

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:40.180
Pitz?

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:42.310
I saved the seeds, Pitz.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:48.980
What's wrong, Pitz?

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:52.820
The Kill-T-Gangs are going to act?

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:55.450
"Soon," he says.

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:56.660
Who says?

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:58.120
Pitz.

00:07:58.120 --> 00:07:59.830
Th-The squirrel...?

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:06.130
At the moment, there are no signs of AEO or NEO activity.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:09.340
He says he knows the approximate time and the location

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:11.340
where the Orgone energy will be used.

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:15.340
Would it make you feel better if we requested a nuclear strike over that area?

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:17.930
They aren't there yet.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:20.350
But they will act tonight.

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:23.850
Commander!

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:28.190
Manatsu Daichi is standing by in the Earth Engine's cockpit.

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.320
The Earth Engine is fixed now, isn't it?

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:33.900
What are you thinking, Daichi?

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:36.910
I've learned the basic controls from my time in the simulator.

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:38.660
Science Chief!

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:42.160
His Earth Driver training was ordered by HQ.

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:44.670
He's been doing it for a while now.

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.250
How will that stopgap training change anything?

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:50.170
You've almost died twice already...

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:51.460
Aren't you scared?!

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:53.920
I am scared.

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:58.720
Actually, I'm terrified.

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:01.970
I'm only a teenager, after all.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:06.440
But if I don't defeat them,

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:08.360
we have no hope.

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:12.990
And hope is only born through choices.

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:19.910
Please begin the launch sequence.

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:31.960
Eyecatch

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:35.590
The lights of these foolish people...

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:40.350
I can't imagine for even a second that Albion would betray us for them.

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:45.060
Can you even imagine not being immortal?

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:47.020
Nope.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:59.410
This really is the greatest!

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:04.250
AEO sighted... It's a Kill-T-Gang!

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:08.000
Its manifestation point has been pinpointed in Gamma sector, within Defensive Zone 1!

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:10.290
It really did appear.

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:11.340
Wow...

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:15.670
Is this predictive ability your singularity?

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:17.590
Pitz told me, that's all.

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:20.220
Pitz doesn't lie.

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:24.970
The ability to predict the use of Orgone energy?

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:27.100
Pegasus rocket is initiating launch sequence!

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:54.210
The Earth Engine's energy is charging!

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:56.420
Pegasus rocket is preparing to purge the Earth Engine!

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:05.560
Earth Engine, expand!

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:25.010
The one from the first time?

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:33.560
Earth Engine has engaged the Kill-T-Gang!

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:34.560
Its attacks aren't hitting!

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:37.310
If it could land a hit, we could shoot it down...

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:39.230
Abreaction.

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.160
Something else is coming?

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:48.530
Daichi is in danger?

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:50.790
Teppei, come with me!

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:56.830
I...

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:01.550
Please, Teppei...

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:03.630
Help Daichi!

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:06.640
If I return to that body,

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:10.310
I don't think I'll be able to stay who I am now!

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:12.810
Suck-It-Up Forte!

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:19.440
Quit dilly-dallying!

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:21.150
You need to get this done,

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:23.900
so we can have our melon tomorrow, right?

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:27.110
The four of us are eating it together.

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:31.490
It has to be all four of us!

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:38.000
Let's all eat together again tomorrow.

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:52.470
Protect Daichi for me, Teppei...

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:09.990
Amarok, huh?

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:16.120
Another Kill-T-Gang!

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:17.160
It's the Type-1!

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:26.470
A dream, an echo singing of pleasant memories

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:28.590
I'm counting on you two.

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:36.640
It glows like that promise I'm sure we made

00:14:50.740 --> 00:15:00.540
It reaches the lonely depths of my soul

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:00.210
These guys...

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:04.340
You're at a disadvantage in close quarters, so try to keep your distance, Daichi!

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:09.760
It's reminding me of a wait somewhere someday

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:18.770
The future blooms in front of my eyes

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:17.810
You're mine!

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:18.770
Daichi!

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:23.690
So I set off to seek you

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:29.440
To say our goodbyes

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:38.620
A dream, a love blooming like the sun in the sky

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:38.620
Teppei...

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:48.300
It's the light of a day when it was my turn to do the protecting

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:41.580
Albion, are you really going to betray us?

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:54.050
I am your opponent!

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:56.430
Today's the day I devour every last Earthling,

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:58.850
and I'm going to snap Albion out of whatever's gotten into him in the process!

00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:06.730
It's telling me that I lost nothing

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:00.680
But you have to go first.

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:01.640
Crap!

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:02.600
Daichi!

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:17.530
Our paths may meet again someday

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:09.650
Just shoot through both of us, Malkin.

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:11.610
That's right...

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:16.450
As long as our Ego Blocks survive, we can't die.

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:27.130
A dream, an echo singing of pleasant memories

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:23.620
It's the same for you, Albion.

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:27.130
But what about that Earthling, I wonder?

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:36.220
It glows like that promise I'm sure we made

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:31.010
I'll shoot whether you move or not, Albion.

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:33.800
After all, I'm not going to kill you.

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:36.220
I am Arashi Teppei.

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:40.680
It gently strokes my cheek

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:45.600
Like sunlight through the trees

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:43.230
I am...

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:46.610
Arashi Teppei!

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:55.450
And I tie it all into a bouquet meant for you

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:49.480
No way!

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:51.320
His Ego Block...

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:29.360
An Ego Block explosion?

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:33.070
Teppei destroyed his own Ego Block?

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:35.530
Teppei...

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:36.780
Impossible!

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:46.160
That blast destroyed both of my legs' vernier thrusters, huh?

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:49.170
I don't have the momentum to take him out.

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:50.630
What do I do?

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:55.920
Are you the one who made Albion crazy, Neoteny?!

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:58.760
Use this.

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:00.390
You know what to do, Daichi?!

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:01.970
So that's it?

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:04.770
What?

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:48.310
Teppei...

00:18:56.230 --> 00:19:00.530
Albion destroyed his own Ego Block.

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:02.990
It's been a hell of a night.

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:07.500
My Machine Goodfellow broke, too...

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:11.170
Is Teppei safe?

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:16.630
His pulse, temperature, brainwaves, and blood pressure are all nominal...

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:19.340
For a normal human.

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:30.940
Teppei!

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:42.070
Teppei, what's that in your hand?

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:45.780
This is...

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:48.250
A Livlaster?

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:52.710
This is the third one, then.

00:19:57.460 --> 00:20:00.130
Are you canceling the request for Akari to be a <i>Kivotos</i> sleeper

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:02.880
out of respect for her own desires?

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:04.640
That is part of it...

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:06.850
But it's not just that.

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:11.850
You've always been too stubborn to listen to anyone.

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:15.310
Honestly, she really takes after you.

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:18.780
My personality isn't quite as nasty as hers.

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:24.610
You've found some hope, haven't you?

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:27.450
Why do you think so?

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:29.410
I can tell...

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:31.830
You're my ex-husband, after all.

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:35.670
I'll leave Akari to you.

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:36.750
Thank you.

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:42.720
I've reported the situation to HQ's Supreme Council,

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:45.590
and they've agreed to keep it classified for now.

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:49.010
I got them to allow Hana to stay here, also.

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:55.480
It seems that your wife isn't the only one who trusts you.

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:58.570
My ex-wife, you mean.

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:11.200
What do you think, Commander?

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:23.840
Thank you, Teppei.

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:25.550
I...

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:27.180
You beat Amarok.

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:29.180
You're really amazing, Daichi.

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:32.470
You keep surprising me.

00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:34.890
So here.

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:47.410
Manatsu Daichi.

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:50.450
Arashi Teppei.

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:52.410
Mutou Hana.

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:54.370
Yomatsuri Akari.

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:59.960
I hereby designate all you as members of the Globe Tanegashima Base's independent attack force,

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:02.090
the Midsummer's Knights.

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:04.920
Midsummer's...

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:05.920
Knights?

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:09.300
"Manatsu" means "Midsummer."

00:22:12.850 --> 00:22:14.390
Then that's it?

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:16.600
Manatsu Daichi,

00:22:16.600 --> 00:22:20.520
I'm officially designating you as the driver of the Earth Engine.

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:23.020
You are also the leader of this team.

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:28.360
From now on, you are Captain Earth!

00:22:30.490 --> 00:22:32.330
What does a Captain do?

00:22:35.160 --> 00:22:36.910
For now, let's just eat our melons.

00:22:37.460 --> 00:22:41.960
Formation

00:22:37.460 --> 00:22:41.960
The Midsummer's
Knights

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:54.760
The gentle breeze sweeps away even tears

00:22:54.760 --> 00:23:00.230
Even the recollections of the way of the stars

00:23:00.230 --> 00:23:05.070
aren't always good things

00:23:06.530 --> 00:23:12.740
I met you again on that faraway day

00:23:12.740 --> 00:23:22.210
Even though we're as close as we are, this distant day is beginning

00:23:22.210 --> 00:23:30.470
You can hear my voice calling out when I'm all alone

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:36.430
More than just love, it's hard to put into words

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:42.310
I'm searching for what to say while I walk beside you

00:23:42.310 --> 00:23:45.360
Instead of saying goodbye,

00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:53.530
I'll just put these love spun tears in my right pocket again tomorrow

00:23:53.530 --> 00:23:56.950
Love is spreading across the world

00:23:56.950 --> 00:24:03.080
And I finally found it, by your side

00:24:14.050 --> 00:24:17.680
The Midsummer's Knights battle the Planetary Gears.

00:24:17.680 --> 00:24:18.970
That's us!

00:24:19.560 --> 00:24:23.400
Hana's predictive abilities send us to a casino in Odaiba,

00:24:23.400 --> 00:24:25.440
where we find Amarok and Malkin.

00:24:26.110 --> 00:24:30.320
And a new member of the Planetary Gears awakens.

00:24:30.740 --> 00:24:33.200
Next time, on episode 8 of <i>Captain Earth</i>:

00:24:33.200 --> 00:24:35.450
Sign From the Dark

00:24:33.700 --> 00:24:35.450
Sign From the Dark.

00:24:35.820 --> 00:24:38.370
Earth Engine, scramble!
